1, "versionNonce": 501825405, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790436097942, "created": 1790436097942, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "storage / pools", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "storage / pools", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "pqRwkQ3kdz5diOVCcIge", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1570, "y": 830, "width": 22, "height": 22, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#fef9c3", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0067", "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 243952176, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2138535113, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790436097942, "created": 1790436097942, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "6gDYmyXJmH9Y7bdFa7sI", "type": "text", "x": 1600, "y": 831, "width": 42.900000000000006, "height": 16.25, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0068", "roundness": null, "seed": 724331759, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1827276680, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790436097942, "created": 1790436097942, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "safety", "fontSize": 13, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "safety", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "VMalGVU4FC4NjMCKQgdh", "type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 880, "width": 1085.7, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0069", "roundness": null, "seed": 1176147659, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 383291067, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790436097942, "created": 1790436097942, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Numbers to say out loud\nPer GPU: 100 requests \u00f7 0.1 s = 1,000 req/s.  10,000 req/s \u2192 10 GPUs floor; run at ~65% and add spares \u2192 ~18.\nBudget 500 ms P95: \u226450 ms waiting in the batcher + 100 ms on the GPU + tens of ms network, keep ~200 ms for one retry.\nAt 100 req/s a 50 ms window holds five requests: the timer, not the size, is the lever.\nEight GPUs, two models: reserve all eight atomically for the big model, drain small batches first, age so neither starves, say the idle cost.", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Numbers to say out loud\nPer GPU: 100 requests \u00f7 0.1 s = 1,000 req/s.  10,000 req/s \u2192 10 GPUs floor; run at ~65% and add spares \u2192 ~18.\nBudget 500 ms P95: \u226450 ms waiting in the batcher + 100 ms on the GPU + tens of ms network, keep ~200 ms for one retry.\nAt 100 req/s a 50 ms window holds five requests: the timer, not the size, is the lever.\nEight GPUs, two models: reserve all eight atomically for the big model, drain small batches first, age so neither starves, say the idle cost.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "SvTN1RVxfVh1vW87tJ4N", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": -60, "width": 477.40000000000003, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0070", "roundness": null, "seed": 1594906053, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 220303125, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790436097942, "created": 1790436097942, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Functional requirements\nA caller sends a prompt, streaming or not, and gets the answer\nPaid and free tiers, paid served first\nSeveral models and versions on one pool\nBatch requests so GPUs stay busy", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Functional requirements\nA caller sends a prompt, streaming or not, and gets the answer\nPaid and free tiers, paid served first\nSeveral models and versions on one pool\nBatch requests so GPUs stay busy", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "0j3WxLPh5BF0bqbTnSS9", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 67.5, "width": 462.00000000000006, "height": 87.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0071", "roundness": null, "seed": 774078588, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1409651981, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790436097942, "created": 1790436097942, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Non-functional\nP95 500 ms end to end \u00b7 availability above the product's own\nBounded tail latency at low and high load\nA dead GPU costs one retry, never a duplicate answer\nOverload degrades free tier first", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Non-functional\nP95 500 ms end to end \u00b7 availability above the product's own\nBounded tail latency at low and high load\nA dead GPU costs one retry, never a duplicate answer\nOverload degrades free tier first", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "zWBkPXBxiz0v7wDW40AB", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 195.0, "width": 454.3, "height": 70.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0072", "roundness": null, "seed": 556759424, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 949798588, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790436097942, "created": 1790436097942, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Clarify first\nFixed batch contract or continuous batching allowed?\nMay I autoscale, rate limit, cache? Or dispatch layer only?\nChat traffic or offline batch? Client waits or polls?", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Clarify first\nFixed batch contract or continuous batching allowed?\nMay I autoscale, rate limit, cache? Or dispatch layer only?\nChat traffic or offline batch? Client waits or polls?", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "HYlteCD9P4mBReJMbmWk", "type": "text", "x": -760, "y": 305.0, "width": 385.00000000000006, "height": 105.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "index": "a0073", "roundness": null, "seed": 897224521, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1810107745, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790436097942, "created": 1790436097942, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "What breaks first\nBatch by size only \u2192 unbounded wait off-peak\nUnbounded queue \u2192 memory and latency explode\nRound-robin dispatch \u2192 one slow GPU stalls a batch\nNo idempotency \u2192 retries double-charge\nCache with a 2% hit rate \u2192 memory for nothing", "fontSize": 14, "baseFontSize": null, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "What breaks first\nBatch by size only \u2192 unbounded wait off-peak\nUnbounded queue \u2192 memory and latency explode\nRound-robin dispatch \u2192 one slow GPU stalls a batch\nNo idempotency \u2192 retries double-charge\nCache with a 2% hit rate \u2192 memory for nothing", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff", "gridSize": null}, "files": {}}